<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Поздравление бабушке</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            background-color: #fce4ec;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ad1457;
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.2rem);
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f06292;
            color: white;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 1.8rem);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.1s;
            margin-top: 20px;
            min-width: 160px;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #ec407a; }
        .btn:active { transform: scale(0.96); }
        .flowers {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #f06292;
            user-select: none;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .flowers-left { left: 10px; }
        .flowers-right { right: 10px; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .flowers { display: none; }
            body { padding: 10px; }
            .container { padding: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="flowers flowers-left">
        🌸<br>🌺<br>🌹<br>🌷<br>🌸<br>🌺<br>🌹<br>🌷
    </div>
    <div class="flowers flowers-right">
        🌷<br>🌹<br>🌺<br>🌸<br>🌷<br>🌹<br>🌺<br>🌸
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Бабушка, с днём рождения тебя,<br>ты готова к поздравлению?</h1>
        <a href="greeting.html" class="btn">Да</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>